1iwd|n|The small, troublesome tumors or swellings about the anus and lower part of the rectum which are technically called hemorrhoids. See Hemorrhoids. [The singular pile is sometimes used.]	V:6g5,65,5~6g5,65,5	n:24ia,47,3~24ia,47,3
