1j70|n|Piety. ; A feeling for the sufferings or distresses of another or others; sympathy with the grief or misery of another; compassion; fellow-feeling; commiseration. ; A reason or cause of pity, grief, or regret; a thing to be regretted.	a:20le,26,1~20le,26,1	v:20le,36,2~20le,36,2
